    explain: 'Mesocolon edema = classical swine fever / edema disease (E. coli), ไม่ใช่ PCVAD\nDiffuse pneumonia เจอใน PCV-2 ได้ แต่คู่กับ mesocolon edema = CSF/Edema disease\n\n✓ PCVAD includes:\n— PMWS: generalized lymphadenopathy + wasting + diarrhea\n— PDNS: dermatitis + nephropathy\n— Reproductive failure (PCV-2 trans-placental)\n— Hepatitis (PCV-2 hepatic form)\n— Jaundice + emaciation = PMWS',
